{"id":"2c1af20182453372","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-lem-fodor-kunene.md","title":"Fodor Pressing-Down Lemma","display":"lem-fodor-kunene — Fodor Pressing-Down Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-fodor-kunene","aliases":["58-lem-fodor-kunene"],"display":"lem-fodor-kunene — Fodor Pressing-Down Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-thm-fodor.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-fodor-kunene"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-fodor-kunene</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fodor-kunene — Fodor Pressing-Down Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3b01159c2b5601b\" href=\"?note=e3b01159c2b5601b\" title=\"../batch20/58-thm-fodor.md\">../batch20/58-thm-fodor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md\">../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为不可数正则基数（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\)</span>，即对非零 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in S\">\\(\\alpha\\in S\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha\">\\(f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md\">../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fodor-kunene} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\Bigr)\\to\\exists\\gamma&lt;\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in S\\mid f(\\alpha)=\\gamma\\},\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fodor-kunene} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\Bigr)\\to\\exists\\gamma&lt;\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in S\\mid f(\\alpha)=\\gamma\\},\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 Fodor 压低引理的标准陈述：回归函数在某个驻子集上为常值。</li>\n<li>旧断言把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}\\{\\alpha\\}\\subseteq[\\kappa]^2\">\\(f^{-1}\\{\\alpha\\}\\subseteq[\\kappa]^2\\)</span> 错当成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的子集，并声称任意二元组染色都有无界单色集；该类型与数学结论都不成立。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-thm-fodor.md","status":"resolved","id":"e3b01159c2b5601b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-fodor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ 且 $\\omega<\\kappa$，即 $\\kappa$ 为不可数正则基数（see [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)$，即对非零 $\\alpha\\in S$ 有 $f(\\alpha)<\\alpha$（see [[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]] and [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)$，即对非零 $\\alpha\\in S$ 有 $f(\\alpha)<\\alpha$（see [[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]] and [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega<\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\alpha)<\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fodor-kunene} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\Bigr)\\to\\exists\\gamma<\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in S\\mid f(\\alpha)=\\gamma\\},\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"f^{-1}\\{\\alpha\\}\\subseteq[\\kappa]^2","display":false},{"te